@archive 0027
@size 5

script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"크림슨을 꽤 많이\n모았군..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 정도만으로도 킹 님께서\n기뻐하시겠어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	bgmStop
		fadeTime = 1
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Lee
	"잘했어, 스바루."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네 덕분에 프로젝터가\n원래대로 돌아왔어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"콘서트는 잘 진행되고 있어?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Lee
	"아무 문제 없이 진행되고\n있어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"다행이다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"아이스...\n왜 그런 짓을\n한 거야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	bgmPlay
		bgm = 33
		fadeTime = 1
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"널 위해서야, 벨..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"미소라만 치워 버리면,\n넌 곧장 정상까지\n날아오를 수 있었어..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"난 그런 걸 부탁한 적 없어!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"남을 해치는 사람이\n인기를 얻고 사랑받을 수 있다고\n생각해!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"넌 너무 착해!\n그러니까 이해하지 못하는 거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"연예계에서 성공한 사람 중에\n더러운 일 조금 안 해 본 사람은\n없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"그렇지 않아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이해하지 못하는 건\n바로 너야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그럼 미소라도 지금 자리에 오기까지\n사람들을 짓밟았다는 거야"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"사람들을 짓밟았다는\n거야!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"그, 그건...!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"미소라는 그런 짓을\n한 번도 한 적 없어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그저 사람들을 행복하게 해 주려고\n최선을 다할 뿐이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그래서 많은 사람들에게\n존경받고 수많은 팬을 거느리고\n있는 거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"미소라는 남에게\n고통을 주는 사람이 아니야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"미소라는 우리의 라이벌일 뿐\n아니라, 우리의 동경의 대상이기도\n해..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"벨...\n정말 미안해..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"어쩌다 보니 그동안\n나 자신을 잃어버렸어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 더는 네 매니저로\n있을 자격이 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"그렇지 않아..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"세상 누구도 너만큼\n날 걱정해 주지는\n않을 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아이스..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"계속 널 걱정하게 만들겠지만,\n그래도 내 매니저를\n계속 맡아 줄래?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"벨...!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"내 매니저는\n너 말고는 안 돼..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"정말 미안해, 벨...\n그리고 고마워..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네 위저드라서 정말\n자랑스러워."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이제 해결된 것 같네."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"잠깐\n걱정했어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Lee
	"여긴 내가 맡을게,\n스바루. 콘서트에\n가야지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"피날레 시간이 거의 다\n됐어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
